OL,3,GNEWSAWhat can go in Wolverhampton's new
OL,4,Afood bins?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWeekly food waste collections have
OL,7,Fbegun for Wolverhampton's kerbside
OL,8,Fhouseholds.
OL,10,FThe scheme, which started on Monday,
OL,11,Fhas been introduced under government
OL,12,Frecycling rules aimed at increasing
OL,13,Frecycling rates and reducing the amount
OL,14,Fof food waste disposed of with general
OL,15,Frubbish.
OL,17,FThe new collections are part of the
OL,18,Fgovernment's Simpler Recycling reforms,
OL,19,Fwhich require councils across England
OL,20,Fto introduce weekly food waste
OL,21,Fcollections.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
