OL,3,GNEWSAWhat can go in Wolverhampton's new
OL,4,Afood bins?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn Wolverhampton, collected food waste
OL,7,Fwill be sent to an anaerobic digestion
OL,8,Ffacility where it can be used to
OL,9,Fgenerate energy and produce fertiliser.
